            "text": "<html><body><h3 id=\"2.12.140\">2.12.140</a> Council decisions &ndash; Validity when rules not observed.</h3> <p>Except as noted herein, the rules adopted in this chapter are procedural and intended to smoothly and efficiently expedite the city council in their deliberations and actions. These rules are not intended to bestow any rights on third parties to attack decisions of the city council for their failure ...</body></html>"
